percentile -- for pairing with
\code{\link[=er_style_vpc_observed_quantile_errorbar]{er_style_vpc_observed_quantile_errorbar()}}. Like that builder (and
like \code{er_style_vpc_simulated_mean_errorbar()}), it adapts its
